sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ATM as Cajero ATM-001
    participant G as Gateway
    participant B as bff-atm
    participant P as payments-service
    participant A as accounts-service
    ATM->>G: POST /atm/withdrawals<br/>JWT(scope atm) + X-ATM-ID + Idempotency-Key
    G->>B: reenvia
    B->>B: AtmTerminalFilter: terminal registrado + auditoria
    B->>B: valida monto (5.000 - 200.000, multiplo de 5.000)
    B->>P: POST /payments/withdrawals (X-Channel ATM)
    P->>A: DEBITO idempotente
    A-->>P: saldo
    P-->>B: COMPLETADA
    B-->>ATM: dispensar=true, saldoDisponible
    Note over ATM,B: Si se corta la red, el cajero reintenta con la MISMA llave:<br/>payments devuelve el resultado original y NO debita dos veces
    Note over B,P: Si payments no responde: CircuitBreaker -> fallback<br/>dispensar=false "No se dispenso dinero" (503)
